  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "99f639fc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Language flags are crude on purpose. Lv = latvian diacritics, ru = cyrillic, en = common english words. First version of the en list missed short posts like \"Orders are coming in non stop!\" so I widened it. Left out \"to\" because it's a really common latvian word too.\n",
    "\n",
    "The export goes up to 2026 because the channel kept posting after 2023, so I cut it to 2019-2023 to get a closed window. Only 5 messages in 2019 (channel starts Nov 2019) so year comparisons start at 2020."
   ]
  },
